From: sn3ro <zak.darek@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 21:50:59 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] docs(mcp): camcraft-mcp skill entry for break_through and
 break_through_from

PR #2504 (#2441) added the drilling break-through fields to the MCP
params, but the camcraft-mcp skill had no entry for them. The entry
gives `break_through` (mm, null for the kind's 1.0 mm; Drill, Bore,
Thread) and `break_through_from` ("full_diameter" default, or "tip";
Drill), their refusals, and how list_operation_types lists them.

Pinned by .claude/skills/camcraft-mcp/tests/test_break_through.py,
which also reads the wire values from BreakThroughFromDto.

Fixes #2529

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
